{%- comment -%}
  Russian mobile drawer (DDS-Foundations redesign). Rendered from _includes/header_ru.html.
  The English drawer stays in _includes/header-mobile.liquid and is untouched.

  .header__sidebar, .header__sidebar--nav, .menu-item-has-children and .sub-menu-container
  are kept so adaptive/header-mobile.js keeps driving the burger, the accordion and the
  cloning of the documentation sidebar without any change.

  No language toggle here - the design has none, and language-switch.js no-ops without it.

  Product icons: the five products covered by the design (Platform, Stronghold,
  Observability, Code, Development Portal) carry the new brand marks inline. The
  remaining four (Virtualization Platform, Delivery Kit, Commander, Prom++) have no
  mark in the design yet and keep the existing sprite reference, so swapping them in
  later is one line per product.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="header__sidebar header__sidebar--ru">
  <div class="header__sidebar-inner">
    <ul id="bottom-header-nav" class="nav header__sidebar--nav">
      {%- unless site.mode == "module" %}
      <li class="header__navigation-item current-menu-parent menu-item-has-children menu-item-has-children--top">
        <a href="#">Продукты</a>
        <div class="sub-menu-container">
          <ul class="sub-menu sub-menu_products">
            <li>
              <a href="/products/kubernetes-platform/">
